## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

TARGET / IDEAL remains inventory-independent. CURRENT omits unavailable Ethyl Linalool and unmodeled Caraway, reallocating only transition functions to linalool, linalyl acetate, and cardamom. Lavender, Cashmeran, Patchouli, and Indian Vetiver use current canonical labels. Exact Exaltolide texture, Haitian vetiver, target lavender, Ambroxide, and Vertofix Coeur remain gaps. Verify EB; purchase only after a constant-total missing-material arm.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-09 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge cardamom-lavender visibility, textile suppleness, cedar/vetiver grain, tobacco/leather/opaque-wood drift, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

